       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "\\",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・ Adjusted so that Cousins, Presents, and Crowns obtained during a stage will remain acquired even if you select “Retry” or “One More Time” after obtaining them. If you return to the Select Scroll during a stage or upon failing a task, the acquired items will be reset.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Improved the operability of wall-climbing actions within stages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Added a function to fast-forward when the King appears.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam® (keyboard): “E” key",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Fixed an issue where players could become stuck between objects in certain areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Made adjustments to some sound effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Made adjustments to other issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
